        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-31T19:23:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's not just Adam's art evolving.&nbsp; The first one is done in watercolor, in something approaching a traditional Asian style.&nbsp; The second is his usual style, done digitally I assume.</p><p>I'd wondered about this as well.&nbsp; I suppose it's because non-Dark Watch Fixer really only suffers one significant defeat?&nbsp; He gets killed pretty early in his story (not counting the Black Fist days) and doesn't get restored until OblivAeon.</p>",
