        "id": 218846,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-31T19:48:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"X-metal\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/x-metal/48/4892_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> X-metal:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>unrelated: what dies the writing in the incap say?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>From this post&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/50041#comment-50041\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/comment/50041#comment-50041</a></p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dpt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/48/1922_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dpt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm not really competent, but I answered it here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/36658#comment-36658\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/comment/36658#comment-36658</a>. The top does read \"Owari\", The End, as you gussed. (I'm not clear how much this implies he is actually dead.)I missed the other block. That is a signature block, and is written in katakana, one of the Japanese phonetic syllabries, the one typically used for foreign words. It reads \"Adamu Rebotaro\", i.e., Adam&nbsp;Rebottaro.In addition to his Nemesis symbol (to fix/mend), the other Kanji I noticed on his cards is on the style cards; I believe they are names of the relevant animal in Japanese, although I haven't checked carefully.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
